hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"134","Qāla \āmantu bi-llāhi wa-rusulihi\"". He says"," \""I believe in God and His messengers.\"""""
"135","Yaqra'u qawlahu ta'ālā: \Huwa al-Awwalu"," wa al-Ākhiru"," wa al-Ẓāhiru"," wa al-Bāṭinu"," wa huwa bi-kulli shay'in ʿAlīm.\"". He recites the words of Allah"," the Most High: \""He is the First"," the Last"," the Manifest"," the Hidden"," and He has full knowledge of all things.\"""""
